[00:24.08]1. Great God, Jehovah, you are deserving,
[00:32.98]Worthy of the highest praise,
[00:36.74]Good and just in all your ways.
[00:42.22]You have such power, deep love, and wisdom.
[00:50.70]You are God to endless days.
[01:18.42]2. Father, we feel your tender compassion.
[01:26.34]We are dust, and still you care;
[01:30.34]Graciously you hear our prayer.
[01:34.76]How you sustain us, teach us, and guide us!
[01:43.76]Help from you is always there.
[02:05.18]3. Heaven and earth now sing of your glory.
[02:07.16]Joyfully with voices raised,
[02:07.16]We exalt you all our days.
[02:35.34]Great God, Jehovah, you are deserving.
[02:44.74]Please accept our heartfelt praise.
